                "text": "I enjoyed touring @cpcc, the second-largest community college in North Carolina. Visiting faculty and students at the Shaw Advanced Manufacturing Building and Leon Levine Health Sciences Center was insightful to see the importance of expanding support for NC's manufacturing and nursing programs to ensure that once students graduate, they are equipped with the experience and knowledge to be successful in joining the workforce.",
