                "text": "The scenes out of UNC-Chapel Hill are heartbreaking, and something that no student, teacher, or parent should\u00a0ever have to live through. Susan and I mourn the innocent life taken. We must all continue to work together to protect our schools, confront the nation's mental health crisis, and keep firearms out of the wrong hands.",
