                "text": "It was great to host another Bipartisan Safer Communities Act roundtable in Charlotte today. Thank you @cltmayor, NC Sen. Burgin, and other leaders for joining me for a thoughtful discussion on mental health care and school safety in North Carolina. https://t.co/iN0CMa9U93",
