                "text": "As someone who grew up in a trailer park and has witnessed firsthand friends struggle with breaking away from a life of drugs and addiction, I applaud @JellyRoll615 for the powerful testimony he provided. I agree that mental health and drug addiction go hand in hand, and I look forward to working together to address these critical issues.",
