                "text": "As a former caregiver to my grandmother with Alzheimer\u2019s, I know firsthand the importance of brain health & the devastating impacts Alzheimer\u2019s can have on our loved ones. This Alzheimer\u2019s & Brain Awareness Month, I\u2019m proud to help spread awareness about brain health & support those living with it and their caregivers.",
