                "text": "September is #SuicidePrevention Month, a time to raise awareness of mental health and offer support to those in need. As co-chair of the Bipartisan Senate Mental Health Caucus, I am proud to partner with organizations like the @988Lifeline to support Americans struggling with mental health crises, reduce the stigma, and save lives.",
